    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hathor's Peak</strong> is a solitaire-inspired card game that blends strategic with the mystique of ancient Egypt. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Mythical Solitaire Adventure</strong>: Combine the strategy of solitaire with the Egyptian mythology. Discover powerful god cards that can transform your game and unlock new strategic possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Card Synergies</strong>: Each card holds unique powers that can be combined. Uncover rare cards and create game-changing combos to overcome even the toughest challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Difficulty</strong>: As you ascend through the peaks, each stage becomes more challenging, demanding clever strategies and quick thinking to prevail.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hathor's Peak</strong> is a solitaire-inspired card game that blends strategic with the mystique of ancient Egypt. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Mythical Solitaire Adventure</strong>: Combine the strategy of solitaire with the Egyptian mythology. Discover powerful god cards that can transform your game and unlock new strategic possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Card Synergies</strong>: Each card holds unique powers that can be combined. Uncover rare cards and create game-changing combos to overcome even the toughest challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Difficulty</strong>: As you ascend through the peaks, each stage becomes more challenging, demanding clever strategies and quick thinking to prevail.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Hathor's Peak: The mystical solitaire adventure. Dive into an enchanting Egyptian journey where ancient cards unlock secrets of the pyramids. Master strategic moves, uncover divine powers, and ascend the sacred peaks of Hathor. A captivating blend of solitaire and mythology awaits!",
